{
  "_id": "index-temple",
  "content": [
    {
      "text": "Nephi1 builds temple after manner of Solomon, 2 Ne. 5:16. mountain of the Lord’s house shall be established in top of mountains, 2 Ne. 12:2 (Isa. 2:2). the Lord’s train filled temple, 2 Ne. 16:1 (Isa. 6:1). Jacob2 teaches in temple, Jacob 1:17. the Lord commands Jacob2 to declare word in temple, Jacob 2:2, 11. Benjamin gathers his people at temple, Mosiah 1:18. the Lord dwells not in unholy temples, Mosiah 2:37 (Alma 7:21; 34:36). Aminadi interpreted writing upon wall of temple, written by finger of God, Alma 10:2. Alma2 and Amulek preach in temples, Alma 16:13. sons of Mosiah2 are given free access to Lamanites’ temples, Alma 23:2 (26:29). the Lord’s Spirit dwells not in unholy temples, Alma 34:36 (Hel. 4:24). Nephi2 is given power to rend temple in twain, Hel. 10:8. multitude is gathered around temple when Christ appears, 3 Ne. 11:1. the Lord shall suddenly come to his temple, 3 Ne. 24:1 (Mal. 3:1).",
